<!-- Teaching layer over exact approved source fb8354e. -->
<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">The backend receives a genuine-looking device verdict beside a different action than the token was requested for. A positive device signal cannot establish that these parameters belong to this piece of evidence.</p>

<!-- @before Server Verification Contract :: animation -->
### Bind the verified details to the received action

